  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the Expression Parameter can only be changed from the Expression Menu, but I would like to be able to change it from an external controller such as a MIDI controller.\nBy doing this, for example, you can control facial expressions in a complicated manner with a foot switch, or connect an instrument to play.\nIt's also desirable to be able to manipulate the Expression Parameter by keystrokes, but it's controversial because some keys are used in desktop mode.",
